<article class="env-lemma" id="0CCW">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0CCW">Lemma <span data-tag="0CCW">53.13.1</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. Let $f : X \to Y$ be a surjective morphism of curves over $k$. If $X$ is smooth over $k$ and $Y$ is normal, then $Y$ is smooth over $k$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Let $y \in Y$. Pick $x \in X$ mapping to $y$. By Varieties, Lemma <a href="/tag/05AX" data-tag="05AX">33.25.9</a> it suffices to show that $f$ is flat at $x$. This follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0CCK" data-tag="0CCK">53.2.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>